<div class="n-label">Plan a visit</div>
<h1 class="n-display" id="title-h" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,1.8rem + 3.4vw,5rem);line-height:.96;max-width:15ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Park once, then walk it</h1>
</div>
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:0;max-width:50ch">Niwot sits off the Diagonal Highway between Boulder and Longmont. Leave the car on or near Second Avenue: the two commercial blocks are within a fifteen-minute walk of each other, and the park and the trail are at their edges.</p>
