<h2 class="n-h2" id="ground-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:16ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Parking, walking and transit</h2>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:18px 0 0;max-width:46ch">Niwot is unincorporated, so parking rules, road work and trail closures are set by Boulder County rather than a town. Posted signs override anything written here.</p>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:22px">
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="https://bouldercounty.gov/transportation/road-maintenance/" rel="noopener">County roads <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
